  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing of short term activities in relation to the Swedish funded  development cooperation programmes in Mali, such as, preparatory      studies, development of underlying documents, extra audits,           translation of documents and local seminars and events. These         activities fall outside of direct contributions, but are still deemed to be important and strategic for the overall development cooperation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansierng mindre bist&#xe5;ndsrelaterade aktiviteter vilka faller        utanf&#xf6;r de direkta insatserna men som bed&#xf6;ms vara relevanta och       strategiska f&#xf6;r utvecklingssamarbetet i Mali. Det kan t.ex. vara      f&#xf6;rberedande studier, konsultinsatser f&#xf6;r att utveckla besluts- och   finansieringsunderlag, extra revisioner, &#xf6;vers&#xe4;ttningar, lokala       seminarier eller liknande</narrative>
  </description>
